<title>USA: Sept CME S&amp;P 500 briefly rises 7-pt opening limit.</title>
<headline>Sept CME S&amp;P 500 briefly rises 7-pt opening limit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>September Standard and Poor's 500 futures briefly rose the opening seven-point limit, but quickly edged down from the morning peak.</p>
</text>
